    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-low to-surface px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary shadow-sm">🇵🇭 Official Philippine MSME Ecosystem • Free Membership</span><h1 class="mt-6 font-headline text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Hindi mo kailangang mag-start at mag-grow ng business nang <span class="text-primary">mag-isa.</span></h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">FLAME PH connects aspiring entrepreneurs and MSMEs with practical learning, trusted business connections, and a growing ecosystem built for the changing, AI-shaped economy.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-secondary-container" href="/membership#registration">Join FLAME PH Free →</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm hover:bg-surface-container" href="/learn"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">menu_book</span>Explore the Learning Hub</a></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface-variant"><span>✓ Free to join</span><span>✓ Practical resources</span><span>✓ Filipino-led community</span></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-xl ring-1 ring-primary/10"><img class="block aspect-[1.69] w-full object-cover" src="/assets/images/flameph-sample-id.png" alt="Sample FLAME PH premium community member ID card"></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary p-5 text-white shadow-2xl sm:p-6"><div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div><p class="relative text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-tertiary-fixed">Start where you are</p><h2 class="relative mt-2 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Build better business habits with people who understand the journey.</h2><div class="relative mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-3 sm:p-4"><strong class="block text-xl sm:text-2xl">{{ number_format($membershipStats['registered_members']) }}</strong>registered members</div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-3 sm:p-4"><strong class="block text-xl sm:text-2xl">{{ number_format($membershipStats['chapter_locations']) }}</strong>local connections</div></div><a class="relative mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-tertiary-fixed underline sm:text-base" href="/membership">See membership options →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="bg-white px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="business-help-heading"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">How FLAMEPH helps</span><h2 id="business-help-heading" class="mt-5 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">How will FLAMEPH help my business today?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant sm:text-base">Whether you are starting, selling, or growing, FLAMEPH helps you save, connect, learn, and become more visible.</p><a class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-primary transition hover:bg-surface-container-high" href="#flame-principle"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-1 text-sm">lightbulb</span>The FLAME Principle: One MSME alone pays more. Together, we can pay less and grow more.</a></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="group rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:shadow-md" href="/membership#registration"><img class="h-52 w-full rounded-xl object-cover object-center shadow-sm" src="/assets/images/home/help-cards/save-together.png" alt="Filipino entrepreneurs saving together through shared business costs" loading="lazy"><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Save together</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Find group-buying opportunities, member deals, shared services, and negotiated partner offers.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium italic leading-6 text-primary">“Mahal ang supplies kapag solo—kaya naghahanap ako ng kasama para mas tipid.”</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Explore member benefits <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></span></a><a class="group rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:shadow-md" href="/directory"><img class="h-52 w-full rounded-xl object-cover object-center shadow-sm" src="/assets/images/home/help-cards/connect-right-people.png" alt="Filipino entrepreneurs connecting with suppliers and business partners" loading="lazy"><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Connect with the right people</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Meet Filipino entrepreneurs, suppliers, professionals, mentors, chapters, and potential business partners.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium italic leading-6 text-primary">“Hindi ko alam kung sino ang mapagkakatiwalaan—one right connection can change everything.”</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Browse the directory <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></span></a><a class="group rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:shadow-md" href="/learn"><img class="h-52 w-full rounded-xl object-cover object-center shadow-sm" src="/assets/images/home/help-cards/learn-operate-better.png" alt="Filipino entrepreneurs learning practical ways to run a business better" loading="lazy"><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Learn and operate better</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Access practical learning resources, business templates, consultations, POS tools, and AI-assisted guidance.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium italic leading-6 text-primary">“Busy ako sa araw-araw na operations, pero kailangan ko ring matutong magplano at mag-track.”</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Explore the Learning Hub <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></span></a><a class="group rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:shadow-md" href="/events"><img class="h-52 w-full rounded-xl object-cover object-center shadow-sm" src="/assets/images/home/help-cards/grow-visibility.png" alt="Filipino entrepreneur growing a local business through online visibility" loading="lazy"><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Grow your visibility</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Create a business profile, appear in the member directory, promote your products or services, join events, and discover market opportunities.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium italic leading-6 text-primary">“Maganda ang produkto ko, pero paano ako mapapansin ng mas maraming customers?”</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Join the directory <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="bg-white px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">The FLAME Principle</span><h2 class="mt-5 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">One MSME alone pays more. Together, we can pay less and grow more.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-on-surface-variant">Small Filipino enterprises unlock stronger connections, shared learning, and better opportunities through community.</p></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-7"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-100 text-secondary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">person_off</span></span><div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Traditional method</span><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold">Operating alone</h3></div></div><p class="mt-5 text-on-surface-variant">Solo operators shoulder full retail markups, isolated risks, and costly technology friction without peer support.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm"><li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-4">✕ High procurement and packaging costs</li><li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-4">✕ Limited referrals and market reach</li><li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-4">✕ Fragmented tools and advisory support</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-container p-7 text-white shadow-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">handshake</span></span><div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary-fixed">The bayanihan advantage</span><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold">With FLAME PH</h3></div></div><p class="mt-5 text-white/85">Connect with Filipino entrepreneurs to learn faster, find trusted suppliers, and discover practical pathways to grow.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm"><li class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4">✓ Community-led learning and referrals</li><li class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4">✓ A directory for local suppliers and partners</li><li class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-4">✓ Shared opportunities for sustainable growth</li></ul></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="bg-surface px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="why-flameph-heading"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary shadow-sm">Why join FLAME PH?</span><h2 id="why-flameph-heading" class="mt-5 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Kapag sama-sama, mas may chance ang bawat Filipino business.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">See how bayanihan turns everyday business challenges into shared opportunities—from saving on costs to reaching bigger markets.</p></div><div class="mt-12 space-y-8 sm:space-y-10">
        <article class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="order-2 flex flex-col justify-center p-7 sm:p-10 lg:order-1"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">01 · Share the load</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Mas tipid kapag may kasama.</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Hindi kailangang solo ang gastos at risk. Sa FLAME PH, we help Filipino MSMEs consolidate demand, find better options, and negotiate with more confidence.</p><p class="mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant"><strong class="text-primary">Halimbawa sa totoong buhay:</strong> Si Ana, na nagluluto ng kakanin sa bahay, ay dating bumibili ng kahon at sangkap nang tingi kaya mas mahal. Nang makahanap siya ng ibang negosyante na pareho ang pangangailangan, sabay-sabay silang bumili at mas napunta ang ipon sa pagpapalago ng negosyo.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="/membership#registration">Sumali para may makasamang mag-ipon →</a></div><div class="order-1 min-h-[17rem] bg-surface-container-low lg:order-2"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/assets/images/home/flameph-shared-costs.png" alt="One MSME alone pays more; Filipino businesses save more by working together" loading="lazy"></div></article>
        <article class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="min-h-[17rem] bg-surface-container-low"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/assets/images/home/flameph-business-flow.png" alt="FLAME PH member cycle showing buy, refer, supply, support, and grow" loading="lazy"></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-7 sm:p-10"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">02 · Make business flow</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Buy, refer, supply, support, grow.</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Every connection can create momentum. Support a member, recommend a trusted business, and keep value moving within our Filipino community.</p><p class="mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant"><strong class="text-primary">Halimbawa sa totoong buhay:</strong> Si Ben ay naghahanap ng maaasahang supplier para sa maliit niyang tindahan. Sa halip na manghula, nakilala niya ang isang supplier sa komunidad, at kalaunan ay siya naman ang nag-rekomenda ng ibang miyembro sa bagong customer.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="/directory">Makilala ang tamang kasama →</a></div></article>
        <article class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="order-2 flex flex-col justify-center p-7 sm:p-10 lg:order-1"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-tertiary-container">03 · Learn to earn</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Practical learning, real next steps.</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">From entrepreneurship basics to digital and AI skills, FLAME PH makes learning useful and actionable—para mas ready kang kumita, mag-start, and create jobs.</p><p class="mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant"><strong class="text-primary">Halimbawa sa totoong buhay:</strong> Si Carla ay masipag magbenta ng ulam pero hindi niya alam kung kumikita ba talaga siya. Matapos matutong magkuwenta ng gastos at gumamit ng simpleng tools, nalaman niya kung ano ang dapat baguhin para hindi nauubos ang kita.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="/learn">Matuto ng susunod na hakbang →</a></div><div class="order-1 min-h-[17rem] bg-surface-container-low lg:order-2"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/assets/images/home/flameph-learning-to-earning.png" alt="Filipino learners moving from education and connection to earning and job creation" loading="lazy"></div></article>
        <article class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="min-h-[17rem] bg-surface-container-low"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/assets/images/home/flameph-local-to-global.png" alt="A Filipino MSME growing from local business into a global Filipino brand" loading="lazy"></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-7 sm:p-10"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">04 · Grow beyond borders</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Start local. Grow together. Scale global.</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Your local business can go further with the right people, place, technology, and market access. Join a network that believes Filipino brands belong on the world stage.</p><p class="mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant"><strong class="text-primary">Halimbawa sa totoong buhay:</strong> Si Dina ay nagsimula sa ilang bote ng sariling sauce para sa mga kapitbahay. Sa tulong ng mas maraming kakilala at tamang market, mas maraming nakakita sa produkto niya at unti-unti siyang nakapagbenta sa labas ng kanilang lugar.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="/membership#registration">Simulan ang pag-angat kasama kami →</a></div></article>
    </div><div class="mt-12 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary px-7 py-4 font-bold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-secondary-container" href="/membership#registration">Join FLAME PH Free →</a><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Free to join. Built for Filipino entrepreneurs and MSMEs.</p></div></div></section>
